{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18276","headline":"早春与张十八博士籍游杨尚书林亭寄第三阁老兼呈白冯二阁老 · 韩愈","name":"早春与张十八博士籍游杨尚书林亭寄第三阁老兼呈白冯二阁老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"墙下春渠入禁沟，渠冰初破满渠浮。\n凤池近日长先暖，流到池时更不流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}